00:11:59.080 --> 00:11:59.700
It wasn't, you know,

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:00.880
the man was, you know,

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:01.540
like when the man

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.580
in his bed is drunk.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:03.800
The next morning

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:04.340
he didn't know.

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:04.940
He didn't know.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.400
Is it true

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:10.980
that in a Jewish religion

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:13.060
a man who commits a crime

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:14.460
that he confesses

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.180
to this crime

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.320
is not acceptable?

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:17.680
This confession?

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.040
Of course.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:19.660
This is one of the things

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.860
You know, the Jamboree Society

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:26.560
The Jamboree Society accuses

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.680
and this is one of the cases the Jamboree Society brought

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.120
The Jamboree Society

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:32.460
says that the American war is to be

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.900
influenced by Talmud, by Talmudic, by the rabbis

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.660
That's one of the things the Jamboree Society says

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.760
And one of the things that they pointed out, this is true

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:40.360
According to Jewish

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.920
Jewish prudence, if a person

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.980
confesses this crime, it could not

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.620
be taken as an evidence against them

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.760
there must be two witnesses

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.660
you must be two witnesses

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.780
that they saw the crime being performed

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:54.120
but if he confesses

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:57.000
you know, the confession cannot be taken

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.320
now, this as we know

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:00.720
this is a capital crime

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.740
any crime, except money

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:04.740
if you say I owe you money

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:06.460
no, but a crime, we're talking not about

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.320
owing money, but let's say for instance

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.400
I, you know

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:11.900
Ba'alti Ishet Is

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.200
or whatever it is, you know, we do not

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.460
accept his confession

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:18.080
murder, morality, anything

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.320
we do not accept the conversation. Now as you know

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.460
Judge Warren from the Supreme

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.180
Court was very close to the

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:25.960
Jewish Theological Seminary. He received a

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:27.460
doctorate on all his accounts and so on.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.660
And it's known in fact that this

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.000
Professor Litterman, he was the one who exposed to him

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:32.880
the whole idea of

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.300
self-incrimination to be

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:37.400
that we do not accept it. So this

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.800
made a tremendous impression on Judge Warren

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:42.140
from the Supreme

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:43.940
Court that he introduces this into

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:46.180
American law. But this is a Jewish

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.140
concept, that a person's confession

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.200
cannot be taken as evidence

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.180
against himself. In other words, you cannot incriminate

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.240
yourself. That's right. This self-incrimination, this is

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.920
Jewish. The whole idea of self-incrimination

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.940
cannot testify against himself.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.260
How do you explain that anything you say

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.060
will be held against you? That's American

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:03.960
law. That's American law.

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:05.400
But now we have a new law,

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:08.300
which is, you cannot,

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.280
self-incrimination is not

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.880
accepted unless they warn you before.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.020
and besides when they say that

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:16.020
anything you say will be held against you

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.160
you may not be confessing

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.120
but you may be giving out evidence

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.680
that would incriminate you

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:22.560
so that they can't help it

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:24.160
they're telling you

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.640
don't say it but if you say it

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:27.460
and you tell them

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:31.120
American law accepts circumstantial evidence

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:31.820
we do not accept

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:34.760
never accept circumstantial evidence

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:38.200
by the way

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.440
it's the most sane system

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:44.580
Because circumstantial evidence, sometimes you could just, I don't know, be grabbing

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:47.780
in the wrong time, in the wrong thing, and you don't have good decent where you were.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.100
Yeah, it's very difficult.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:51.420
I don't know about you, but you may not know.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.280
So why are they so concerned about not getting the high end?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.060
No, only if you cannot be accused.

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:57.440
I mean, you cannot go into court.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:02.720
Yeah, you should be trying to be, because people will talk, will murmur, but they cannot

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:06.680
be brought to court, you know, on circumstantial evidence.

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:08.960
Well, today, Rabbi, if a person does commit a crime

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.760
and goes to the police and confesses,

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.680
is that enough to...

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:13.340
Hold them.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.540
I don't know how it's American law.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:16.220
Really, I don't know.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:17.700
The only thing I know is that...

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.780
He confesses and he signs to it.

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:22.560
Which is not right.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.240
Not right.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:25.440
Unless he has a lawyer.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.660
I really don't know how it's American law.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:27.840
Unless he has a lawyer.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.040
But I know I'm going to do so.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:32.860
Even if you would come and confess,

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.640
I killed so-and-so, I did this and this,

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.700
they do not accept this life.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.660
He may be under suspicion.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.120
Even today.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.440
They can't deny it.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:43.580
Even today.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.900
What he's saying, if there's anything to it.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.280
And they have evidence.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:50.820
I really don't know how American

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:51.900
I really don't know.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:52.380
I mean, even

00:15:52.380 --> 00:16:01.560
I've been asked, how could one

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.800
explain or understand God's

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:05.940
conversation to kind. The truth of the matter

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.720
is, this is already the Geonim they said,

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.380
the ancient Jewish rabbis, they said,

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.420
this is a question of experience. In other words,

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.840
we don't know how God speaks to men, or how

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:16.020
men could speak to God. It's in a way

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:17.440
like the Rambam says very clearly,

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.760
suppose a person was born blind, he never saw color.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.900
You cannot explain color. Color is a question

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.280
you have to either experience it,

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:25.840
if you never experience it, you cannot, there's no way

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.020
to explain it. So, there is, we believe

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:30.100
there is such an experience of men speaking to God.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.560
What exactly is,

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:34.200
I can't describe it. I never had this experience.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.460
But what is important

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.500
to do is that we believe

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.080
that God could communicate with man.

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:41.620
The fact that God created man

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:44.560
means that God knows how to communicate

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.580
with man. But how this communication

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.580
takes effect, nobody knows. This is the truth.

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.460
I mean, nobody...

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:52.580
You could experience color

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.940
by the way without ever seeing it.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.760
How? Description of words.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:57.520
No, you cannot.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.160
If all your soul is black,

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.160
If all your soul is black all your life, how do you know what it is?

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:04.020
Black bodies, you cannot.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:04.820
That's true.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:09.580
You described a person, a criminal, who is insane,

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:12.060
that he's exculpated because he's insane.

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:15.260
Not in exculpated, it's not subject of law.

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.040
Also a person who is intoxicated.

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:17.800
That's right.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.940
Supposedly an intoxicated person chose voluntarily to be intoxicated.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.140
What do you mean?

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:23.620
He took a drink to become drunk.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.760
He was guilty of becoming drunk, and there's a crime against this.

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:31.900
But everything subsequent is not a crime.

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.540
In other words, he's guilty of becoming drunk.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.740
But that's not murder or whatever it is.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:39.380
He became drunk, and after he became drunk,

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:40.200
I'm going to kill somebody.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.700
So we punish him because of disturbing the peace

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:43.460
of becoming drunk.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:44.720
But that's for killing.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:45.900
When you say becoming drunk,

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.820
it means totally without any ability to control himself.

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:49.540
To control himself.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:50.840
Not just have drunk.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:51.360
No, no, no.

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:52.240
It's completely...

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:54.920
It says drunk is described according to Jewish law.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:55.680
to be fatur,

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:58.560
in the same status as Lord.

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:00.960
Lord, when he was drunk,

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:03.460
he was not aware of what he was doing.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.380
Anything less than that,

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.320
that's right.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:09.720
Let me continue, gentlemen, please.

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:11.560
What was it on the drunk community?

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:14.540
By yese kai,

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:15.500
milipni adonai.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.140
And upon this,

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:20.860
kain walks away from God,

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.260
means relationship between God

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:25.560
mankind is completely terminated,

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.760
never, never again

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:29.440
they ever have any kind of

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:31.700
relationship. By yesher

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.480
the earth is not. And he

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.620
starts inhabiting the land

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.280
of wandering.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.160
Of wandering. In other words,

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.840
that is a plain word.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.200
He starts wandering.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:44.980
It's not Eden.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:47.480
That is the east of Eden

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.340
which even Asra says

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:51.360
