00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:00.580
when kind in heaven were born,

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:05.980
they don't say, and Eve gave birth to a child, and she called him, you know, Hebel, or Cain.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:12.740
Or for instance, when Cain gives birth to children, he doesn't say that was born a child, and he called him Hanoh.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:18.060
Like for instance in the Rahez, she gave birth to a child, and the child was called Reuben, or Shimon, or whatever it is.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.740
So you say, this doesn't appear. Why not?

